    "m_Title": "",
    "m_Content": "The greater the distance, the less of the alpha mask is going to be applied. We subtract the signed vertical distance here so positive number being subtracted (player above wall) means more of the mask appears, and less of the mask appears when the character is close or bellow the walls ",
